Subject: [PATCH 02/18] Quoted strings in selectors, fonts, counter styles,
 content and grid areas are escaped through CSSString, and at-rules keep their
 descriptors in order and read their body from init(rawValue:)
 (swift-w3c/swift-w3c-css#13)

